# Bite-check of the corrected sb_deny 'deny' rule (2026-10-03, local, KVM, deny-policy OVMF built by
# scripts/display/build_ovmf_deny.sh from QEMU 10.2.4's roms/edk2). A throwaway copy of gop_standin.sh
# added one arm, sb_deny_broken: the tail-padded ROM with its PE signature overwritten ("XX" at 0x200),
